    {
      "air_date": "2013-10-09T00:00:00-07:00",
      "episode_count": 23,
      "id": 3699,
      "name": "Season 2",
      "overview": "Sworn to fight crime and corruption in his city, Oliver Queen \u2013 with the help of tech-savvy Felicity Smoak and his iron-fisted right hand, John Diggle \u2013 narrowly averts the rich and powerful\u0027s \u0022Undertaking\u0022 as the Dark Archer rocked Queen\u0027s world in the first season finale of ARROW. But who\u0027s going to pick up the pieces? In Season Two, see how Oliver Queen goes from Hood to Hero!",
      "poster_path": "/wF9HS0mLjO0rwjUYw9iCxlpy0KU.jpg",
      "season_number": 2
    },
    {
      "air_date": "2014-10-08T00:00:00-07:00",
      "episode_count": 23,
      "id": 62018,
      "name": "Season 3",
      "overview": "Protecting his city from crime and corruption, vigilante hero Oliver Queen (aka The Green Arrow) uses his formidable combat skills and marksmanship to go up against lethal foes including Deathstroke, Ra\u0027s al Ghul and Damien Darhk\u0027s HIVE, becoming a beacon of hope for all in need.",
