      "season_number": 3
    },
    {
      "air_date": "2015-10-07T00:00:00-07:00",
      "episode_count": 23,
      "id": 67989,
      "name": "Season 4",
      "overview": "After defeating his most formidable foe to date, Oliver Queen left Starling City with the hopes of beginning a new life with longtime flame Felicity Smoak. But will Oliver ever truly be able to leave behind his past as the Arrow, and, if so, what becomes of his team? Will Diggle, Thea, and Laurel continue the crusade? And with Malcolm Merlyn leading the League of Assassins is anyone really safe?",
      "poster_path": "/hAl1Ypfsb01UOUGNmopMu6skThT.jpg",
      "season_number": 4
    },
    {
      "air_date": "2016-10-05T00:00:00-07:00",
      "episode_count": 23,
      "id": 79710,
      "name": "Season 5",
      "overview": "Protecting his city from crime and corruption, vigilante hero Oliver Queen uses his formidable combat skills and marksmanship to go up against lethal foes including Deathstroke, Ra\u0027s al Ghul and Damien Darhk and Prometheus, becoming a beacon of hope for all in need.",
